WEBVTT

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.976
As far as the individuals are concerned --

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.976
I was asked one time about that,

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.168
and they said,

00:14:07.192 --> 00:14:12.007
"Suppose that you, in some way,
could make the perfect player.

00:14:12.031 --> 00:14:13.191
What would you want?"

00:14:13.215 --> 00:14:16.191
And I said, "Well, I'd want
one that knew why he was at UCLA:

00:14:16.215 --> 00:14:18.976
to get an education,
he was a good student,

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.500
really knew why he was there
in the first place.

00:14:21.524 --> 00:14:23.390
But I'd want one that could play, too.

00:14:23.414 --> 00:14:27.579
I'd want one to realize that defense
usually wins championships,

00:14:27.603 --> 00:14:29.674
and who would work hard on defense.

00:14:29.698 --> 00:14:31.976
But I'd want one
who would play offense, too.